Synergy vs. interaction — clarified. The 15pp criterion above is a composite-system incremental benefit hypothesis, not a factorial interaction. A genuine interaction estimand would ask whether the combined effect departs from an additive or multiplicative model:

\text{Interaction}_{ij} = \Delta_{A_{ij}} - (\Delta_{A_i} + \Delta_{A_j}) - \Delta_{A_0}.

These must not be conflated.

